  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is the second phase of the GEF-financed, UNDP-supported ATSEA program, and is designed to enhance regional collaboration and coordination in Arafura and Timor Seas (ATS) region. ATSEA-2 will specifically focus supporting the implementation of the endorsed strategic action program (SAP), a 10-year vision for the Arafura-Timor Seas with the long-term objective &#x201c;to promote sustainable development of the Arafura-Timor Seas region to improve the quality of life of its inhabitants through</narrative>
