9	129 people from coastal communities made aware on development and establishment of Marine Protected Areas (MPAs); An area (Betano-Clacuc) in Manufahi Municipality identified for MPA establishment; Contract signed with the Coral Triangle Centre Indonesia to establish an MPA in Betano-Kalukuki and produce a management and financial sustainability plan for NKS National Park MPA.
