11	22 people trained on plastic recycling; 30 people trained on production of affordable fish feeds from the locally available materials; 10 women trained on sea food processing; 10 fishers trained on boat repair and maintenance; 10 women trained on fish handling, value addition and financial management skills; 81 trained on fisheries group establishment &amp; management; 4750 trees planted (by 140 community volunteers through climate change awareness campaigns/events</narrative>
